    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2545550/extras/e3c2cce33c7e3aa79320fbdd0cc55fed.poster.avif?t=1713590040\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2545550/extras/e3c2cce33c7e3aa79320fbdd0cc55fed.webm?t=1713590040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2545550/extras/e3c2cce33c7e3aa79320fbdd0cc55fed.mp4?t=1713590040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Survive</strong><br>The main goal will be survival, for this you need to repair the broken airplane using the infrastructure saved for the winter period.<br><br><strong>Overcome</strong><br>One of the core mechanics of the game is overcoming obstacles using a tool that the player has to find or craft.<br><br><strong>Harsh conditions</strong><br>The dynamic change of day, the variety of weather conditions is not just visual noise, but an important mechanic affecting character indicators and the perception of the game world.<br><br><strong>Wild Animals</strong><br>The ecosystem of the taiga, randomly generates events for the player. The animals are dangerous in their own way and require a certain approach.<br><br><strong>Adapt</strong><br>Heroes from improvised materials build their everyday life - create tools, weapons and traps for hunting and scaring off predators, build temporary shelters.<br><br><strong>Victory</strong><br>In The White Prison, the main antagonist is represented by man, in confrontation with whom the tragic contrast that there is no beast more terrible than man is revealed.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2545550/extras/e3c2cce33c7e3aa79320fbdd0cc55fed.poster.avif?t=1713590040\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2545550/extras/e3c2cce33c7e3aa79320fbdd0cc55fed.webm?t=1713590040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2545550/extras/e3c2cce33c7e3aa79320fbdd0cc55fed.mp4?t=1713590040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Survive</strong><br>The main goal will be survival, for this you need to repair the broken airplane using the infrastructure saved for the winter period.<br><br><strong>Overcome</strong><br>One of the core mechanics of the game is overcoming obstacles using a tool that the player has to find or craft.<br><br><strong>Harsh conditions</strong><br>The dynamic change of day, the variety of weather conditions is not just visual noise, but an important mechanic affecting character indicators and the perception of the game world.<br><br><strong>Wild Animals</strong><br>The ecosystem of the taiga, randomly generates events for the player. The animals are dangerous in their own way and require a certain approach.<br><br><strong>Adapt</strong><br>Heroes from improvised materials build their everyday life - create tools, weapons and traps for hunting and scaring off predators, build temporary shelters.<br><br><strong>Victory</strong><br>In The White Prison, the main antagonist is represented by man, in confrontation with whom the tragic contrast that there is no beast more terrible than man is revealed.",
    "short_description": "The White Prison is a tragic and thrilling story about the confrontation of indigenous peoples, the impending civilization, told through the prism of a survival simulator. Take the role of polar aviation pilots who made an emergency landing in the Siberian taiga and try to survive.",
